  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Old Baroque, where opulence meets elegance in a symphony of extravagant accessories and jewelry for the fashion-forward connoisseur. Step into a world where luxury knows no bounds, and each piece tells a story of refined taste and timeless allure.</span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Product description:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">At Old Baroque, we curate a collection that transcends trends, offering handcrafted masterpieces inspired by the grandeur of the Baroque era. From statement necklaces dripping in pearls to intricately designed brooches adorned with precious gems, our pieces are a celebration of craftsmanship and sophistication.</span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none; float: none; display: inline;\">fashion-forward connoisseurs a curated collection of handcrafted jewelry and accessories inspired by the grandeur of the Baroque era, blending opulence with elegance to create timeless masterpieces that transcend trends.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Payment terms:&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Terms of Payment for the OldBaroque.com Affiliate Program</span></p>\r\n<ol style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" start=\"1\" data-spread=\"true\">\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Payment Schedule: Commissions are paid on a monthly basis, within 15 business days following the end of each calendar month.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Payment Method: Payments will be made via PayPal or bank transfer, as selected by the affiliate during registration. The affiliate is responsible for ensuring that payment details are accurate and up to date.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Payout Threshold: A minimum of $50 in earned commissions is required before payment is issued. If the balance is below $50, it will roll over to the next payment period.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Commission Validation: Commissions are subject to a 30-day holding period to account for customer returns, cancellations, or chargebacks. Only commissions from completed and non-disputed transactions will be payable.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Tax Compliance: Affiliates are responsible for any taxes or fees associated with receiving payments under this program. OldBaroque.com may require completion of applicable tax forms prior to disbursing payments.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Currency: All commissions are calculated and paid in euro (EUR).</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Payment Disputes: Any disputes regarding commission payments must be submitted in writing within 30 days of the payment date. Failure to submit a dispute within this period will result in forfeiture of the right to contest the payment.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Program Changes: OldBaroque.com reserves the right to modify these terms, including payment schedules and methods, at any time. Affiliates will be notified of changes via email or through the affiliate dashboard. Continued participation in the program constitutes acceptance of any such modifications.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">By participating in the OldBaroque.com Affiliate Program, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to these Terms of Payment.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Other information:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n</div>",
